    "updated_at": "2020-12-26T13:01:22Z",
    "body": "SOLUTION\r\n//////////////////////////\r\n\r\nCHECK HTTP VERSION 1.0/2.0/3.0 **DYNAMICALLY** BEFORE LANDING HTML PAGE ON CHROME BROWSER. \r\n\r\n`<HTML HTTP=<ol>\r\n  <li>HTTP/1.0</li>\r\n <li>HTTP/1.1</li>\r\n  <li>HTTP/2.0</li>\r\n  <li>HTTP/3.0</li>\r\n</ol>/>`\r\n",
